### Create order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Abhiram",
  "foodItem": "Chicken Burger",
  "quantity": 2,
  "price": 149.50
}

### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### Get order by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

### Replace an order
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Abhiram Kumar",
  "foodItem": "Paneer Pizza",
  "quantity": 3,
  "price": 199.00
}

### Partially update an order
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 4
}

### Delete an order
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

### Invalid create: validation errors expected
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": " ",
  "foodItem": "",
  "quantity": 0,
  "price": -1
}

### Invalid PATCH: empty object expected to return 400
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Missing order expected to return 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/999
